{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Blightened</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the corruption when the cycle begins. Blight is both your weapon and your curse. Harness unstable energy, explore fractured realms, and overcome monstrous guardians in a world lost to time and reality.  <br> <br><strong>Core Genre Tags:</strong> Metroidvania \u2022 2.5D Action Platformer \u2022 Dark Fantasy</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blight as a Weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel your attacks and abilities with blight, a volatile force that grows stronger and more unstable the deeper you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality-Bending Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse ruptures in time where environments twist, fracture, and mutate as your corruption deepens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the Past</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth relics, whispers, and corrupted memories scattered across ruins frozen in collapsing timelines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Realms</strong><br>Journey through frozen wastelands, fungal tombs, and ancient sanctuaries outside the flow of time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monstrous Combat</strong><br>Face brutal foes like the Mountain Fist Golem in fast, precision-driven battles.     <br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/5324b140722a7f917edb196eab7177d5.poster.avif?t=1757022666\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760340/extras/5324b140722a7f917edb196eab7177d5.webm?t=1757022666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea